git commit -m "docs: plan event CRUD endpoints with role-based access

Added event management endpoint specifications:

Public (No Login Required):
- GET /api/events - List all events
- GET /api/events/{id} - View single event details

Organiser Only:
- POST /api/events - Create new event
- PUT /api/events/{id} - Update owned event
- DELETE /api/events/{id} - Delete owned event

Request/Response details:
- Create: { eventName, eventType, eventDate, location, description }
- Update: Same fields as create (all optional)
- Delete: No request body, returns 204 No Content

Error handling:
- 403 Forbidden when not the event owner
- 404 Not Found when event doesn't exist
- 400 Bad Request for validation errors

This continues the API endpoint plan for Section B.

This is commit #9 of 20."
